1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
We're Mykhailo, Vlad and Pavlo,
team hackteamVLDK. This is ASTRA.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Kids aged seven to twelve land in Jezero Crater
and rebuild a half-buried Mars base.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
ASTRA, the station AI, explains real science:
soil over the rooms blocks radiation.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Dust storms, freezing nights and solar flares
become nine quick repair games.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
The Rover explores the crater
and brings back parts to grow the base.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Each event unlocks a card from a real NASA mission.
We fact-checked a hundred claims.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
No one dies here. You learn why. Thanks!
